ren\\\":\\\"Envenox is a software development firm. We design, build and hand over the systems a business runs on — custom software, web applications, ERP, CRM, and the cloud platforms underneath them. What makes the work defensible is that we keep an offensive security practice on staff: our penetration testers read the code our engineers are writing and file findings into the same sprint backlog, so a system arrives already attacked rather than waiting for its first external test. That practice also works on its own, for clients who never buy a line of code from us. We work with regulated organisations across finance, healthcare, logistics and public sector, and we publish our own security posture at /trust.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"15:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-section\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n.sec {\\\\n  position: relative;\\\\n  background-color: var(--bg);\\\\n  color: var(--fg);\\\\n}\\\\n/* Grain sits at z-index 1 with pointer-events none; content rides above it. */\\\\n.sec \\u003e .u-container,\\\\n.sec \\u003e .sec__bleed { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\\\\n\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\\\",\\\"data-theme-section\\\":\\\"deep\\\",\\\"style\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"capacity-heading\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-container\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"capacity-heading\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Capacity, with its provenance\\\"}],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-statbar\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n.statbar {\\\\n  display: grid;\\\\n  gap: var(--s8);\\\\n  list-style: none;\\\\n  margin: 0;\\\\n  padding: 0;\\\\n}\\\\n.statbar \\u003e li { min-width: 0; }\\\\n\\\\n@media (min-width: 640p